# Copy this file to local.properties and paste your real key.
# local.properties is gitignored — your key never enters the repository.
#
#   cp local.properties.example local.properties
#
# Where to get it:
#
#   GEMINI  https://aistudio.google.com/apikey -> key starts with "AIza"
#
# Optional. If it is absent the Gemini provider reports unavailable and JARVIS falls back
# to NVIDIA, whose key is compiled into the app (see docs/SECURITY.md). An environment
# variable of the same name takes precedence over this file.
#
# NVIDIA_API_KEY is deliberately NOT listed here: nothing reads it any more. It used to be
# a BuildConfig field populated only from System.getenv(), which is empty for a normal
# `./gradlew assembleDebug`, so the hardcoded fallback in ApiConfig.kt was doing all the
# work. Setting it in this file would have had no effect.
#
# ElevenLabs support was removed on 2026-09-07 and takes no key.

GEMINI_API_KEY=
